{
  "version": "2026-04-24",
  "name": "feishu_interactive_06_followup",
  "description": "正式版 06 催办 interactive card 模板。用于催办当前责任人并明确回报时限和下一责任人。",
  "message_type": "followup",
  "message_code": "06",
  "label": "催办",
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "orange",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title_prefix}｜06 催办"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "催办单 · {task_name}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**✦ 催办概览**\n事项名称｜{task_name}\n当前责任人｜{owner_mention}\n下一责任人｜{next_owner_mentions}\n当前状态｜{status}\n催办目标｜{goal}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◈ 催办清单**\n- ☐ {deliverable_1}\n- ☐ {deliverable_2}\n- ☐ {deliverable_3}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◔ 时间与要求**\n当前状态｜{status}\n回报时点｜{progress_deadline}\n最晚时限｜{deadline}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**☰ 后续动作**\n{actions_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**receipt｜**以回读与 mention 验证为准。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "default_values": {
    "next_owner_mentions": "-"
  },
  "business_sections": {
    "actions": {
      "render_key": "actions_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "action_item_",
      "max_items": 3,
      "required": true
    }
  },
  "required_placeholders": [
    "title_prefix",
    "task_name",
    "owner_mention",
    "goal",
    "deliverable_1",
    "deliverable_2",
    "deliverable_3",
    "status",
    "progress_deadline",
    "deadline",
    "actions_md"
  ]
}
